1. Figma AI prompt — Music Playlist Manager
------------------------------------------

Create a modern responsive wireframe for a "Music Playlist Manager" app homepage.

Include:
- A top navigation bar with the app logo, Home, My Playlists, Browse, and Profile.
- A prominent search bar for finding songs, artists, and playlists.
- A "Recently Played" section with horizontal music cards.
- A "My Playlists" section showing playlist cards with cover images, playlist names, creator names, and song counts.
- A "Recommended Playlists" section.
- A sidebar or filter area for Genres such as Pop, Rock, Hip-Hop, Jazz, and Classical.
- A footer containing About, Help, Privacy, and Terms links.

Use a clean modern music-streaming layout with clear hierarchy, card-based sections, consistent spacing, and a desktop-first wireframe style. Keep the design suitable for later conversion into a responsive web application.



4. BookMyShow-style movie card — HTML + CSS only
------------------------------------------------
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Movie Card</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .movie-card {
      width: 280px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .movie-poster {
      width: 100%;
      height: 380px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .movie-content {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .movie-title {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 21px;
      color: #222;
    }

    .movie-rating {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: #f2f2f2;
      color: #333;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .book-button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: #e51b23;
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .book-button:hover {
      background: #c9141b;
    }

    @media (max-width: 400px) {
      .movie-card {
        width: 90%;
      }

      .movie-poster {
        height: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="movie-card">

    <img
      class="movie-poster"
      src="movie-poster.jpg"
      alt="Movie poster"
    >

    <div class="movie-content">

      <h2 class="movie-title">
        Avengers: Endgame
      </h2>

      <div class="movie-rating">
        ⭐ 4.5/5
      </div>

      <button class="book-button">
        Book Now
      </button>

    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
